text = "1. You have the option to choose from three levels of varying difficulty. 
2. Use the left, right, up, and down arrows to move the player
3. You must stay on the platform and collect all the required (gold) coins
4. The purple coins are optional, but you gain a point each time you collect one
5. If you collect all the required coins and reach the endpad before the time runs out, you win. 
However, if you reach the endpad without having collected all the required coins, you lose.
6. If the time runs out before you reached the endpad, or if you fall off the platform, the level will automatically restart.
If it restarts because you fell from the platform, the timer will continue from where it left off. 
"
